%%{init: {'theme':'neutral'}}%%
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor You
  participant P as Wingman panel
  participant C as aimux core (one contract)
  participant O as OpenShell
  participant PL as Planner (sandbox)
  participant G as Tool gateway
  participant R as Reader (sandbox)
  participant W as Writer (no tools)
  You->>P: ask, "Use my context" on
  P->>C: start run, profile research-with-work, question + page
  C->>C: Wingman may use this profile? resolve digest
  C->>O: sandboxes with policy compiled from the profile
  C->>PL: question only, never the page
  PL->>G: reviewed read-only calls (Jira, Slack, notes)
  Note over PL,G: names checked twice: gateway + OpenShell
  PL-->>C: typed output: search queries, claims to check
  C->>C: query check
  alt a query names a person, ticket or secret
    C-->>P: preview: send without it, my question only, or as is
    You->>P: choose
  end
  C->>R: approved queries + page text, nothing private
  R->>O: web search and GET fetch (audited)
  R-->>C: findings with sources
  C->>W: question + private evidence + findings
  W-->>C: answer (no tools, no network)
  C-->>P: progress events, then the answer with both kinds of source
  C->>C: record run: profile digest, three sessions, archived for search
  Note over You,C: later: the same run is listed on the phone and in the dashboard, and can be continued there
